      "type": "action",
      "name": "The Dryad's Whispers",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "reaction"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature enters within 10 feet</p><hr /><p>The creature must make a @Check[type:will|dc:28] save. On a critical failure, the creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} or increases the frightened value from Apparitions of Death by 1; this frightened value does not automatically reduce on its own while the affected creature remains in Whitewillow. On a failure, nothing happens to the creature. On a success, the creature is cured of the frightened condition from Apparitions of Death. On a critical success, the creature is cured of the frightened condition from Apparitions of Death and gains a +1 status bonus to will saves against Whitewillow's haunts and Myrianna's abilities.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-conversion-rotrl.rotrl-items.Item.5hJxUK6IMxSTwkP3]{Effect: Whispers of Regret}</p>",
